@WebApiAuth_HostAddress = https://localhost:7178

GET {{WebApiAuth_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{WebApiAuth_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Username" : "user123",
  "Password" : "Pass123!"
}

